				<description>&lt;p&gt;Some meetups are better shown than told. Here is June&amp;rsquo;s show &amp;amp; tell night, in pictures.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/post-1.png&#34; alt=&#34;Members gathered around the demo tanks&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Doors at seven, and the demo tanks drew a crowd before the kettle had even boiled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/post-2.png&#34; alt=&#34;A planted tank in full colour&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Riko&amp;rsquo;s two-year-old planted scape, the deserved star of the evening.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/post-3.png&#34; alt=&#34;The shrimp swap table&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;The swap table: cherry shrimp, cuttings, and more spare sponge filters than anyone will admit to owning.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
